# Trace: Shared-to-Modified upgrade
# Tests that upgrading S→M does not corrupt the requesting core's data
# Two cores read (both get Shared), then core 0 writes (upgrade)
0 READ 0x1000
1 READ 0x1000
# Core 0 upgrades from Shared to Modified
0 WRITE 0x1000 0xB2
# Core 0 reads back — should see the written value
0 READ 0x1000
